  "description": "Tencent Cloud CLS log search skill. Use it when retrieving or aggregating logs, counting errors, analysing trends, locating failures by Trace ID / IP, or when a structured search statement fails and must be generated from natural language. 触发词：日志、CLS、日志检索、日志查询、查日志、错误日志、ERROR、WARN、异常堆栈、堆栈、 Trace ID、日志量、错误率、日志分析、日志趋势、SQL 检索、自然语言转检索语句。 何时不触发：指标类查询（Prometheus/APM 指标）、告警历史、RUM 前端监控、资源盘点不走本 Skill。",
